Read AGENTS.md first. It carries the architecture, the layer rules and the build traps for this
DHIS2 Android plugin project, and nothing here repeats them.

Two workflows, both plain prose:
- docs/workflows/initialise-plugin.md — one-time setup of a fork (./init.sh).
- docs/workflows/plugin-from-spec.md — build a feature from a spec in specs/.

./verify.sh is the definition of done.
